      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought that you wanted to use the same approach as RKP VM and have a hardcoded RB index but that doesn\u0027t seem to be the case. How does this work w.r.t. sealing CDIs i.e. what prevents an attacker from performing a RB attack with an older, vulnerable, version and leaking them?",
